    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        268,
        1720,
        1836,
        2133
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have created a Civic Committee, the honorary co-chairmen of which are Ambassadors George W. Ball, Arthur J. Goldberg, Henry Cabot Lodge, Jr., James J. Wadsworth, James Russell Wiggins, Charles W. Yost, and Mr. John D. Rockefeller, III. The Committee, drawn from all segments of the City, numbers approximately 350 people.",
