        2173,
        1877,
        2593
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The 25th General Assembly session opened on September 15; this year, however, the main thrust will occur during the commemorative period which covers approximately 2 weeks: October 14 - 23, culminating on U.N. Day on October 24. Many heads of state will come to New York City during this period; estimates at present indicate that there will",
